# Synthetic consumer fixture for isolated qualification. This pack's ontology
# asserts af:speedrunProjection/af:projectsTo/af:explicitConsentRequiredFor
# against stn:* individuals -- real, admitted facts typed for real at
# packs/speedrun-talent-network-pack/ontology.ttl. rdf:type values below are
# copied verbatim from that pack's own ontology.ttl (not guessed), per this
# repo's "restate the real fact minimally" discipline (PR #22). Found by
# scripts/check_cross_pack_references.py (RC2 lint).
@prefix stn: <https://chatmangpt.com/ontology/speedrun-talent-network#> .

stn:SpeedrunTalentNetwork a stn:BuildingBlock .
